WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.700
Staged demo of the actual extension with sample inputs. No live store, no model, nothing sent.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.900
First run: search the 178-card catalog and add the cards you own. No card numbers or bank login.

3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.900
One question: share usage reports or not. The extension works the same either way.

4
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.400
Not now: no usage reports are sent.

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.500
On a cart page, the badge names your best card from the order summary. This fictional sample store is in a test copy of the store list.

6
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.800
Every card you own, ranked, with the rule in the issuer’s words, its conditions and why the store’s category applies.

7
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.100
A gift card is applied here, so the amount is not certain: the badge ranks your cards by rate instead of guessing.

8
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.200
The toolbar popup compares any amount you type, at any store.

9
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.200
$3.00 on $100: a conditional estimate from the issuer’s published terms, not an earned reward.
